{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object approached, then take object and check object properties. Else, approach object and move to search area. list of available nodes: <Condition ID = ObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = ObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToSearchArea    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObject    />\"",
